@startuml
title 8. Generación de borrador con LLM

actor Inspector
participant Frontend
participant "LLM Report API\nPOST /api/v1/llm-report/generate/{inspection_id}" as LlmRoute
participant "llmreportservice.generatellmreportdraft" as LlmService
participant "llmreportservice.buildsnapshot" as SnapshotBuilder
participant "llmreportservice.getllm" as LlmFactory
participant "ChatOllama / Ollama" as Ollama
database DB

Inspector -> Frontend: Solicita borrador con LLM
Frontend -> LlmRoute: POST /api/v1/llm-report/generate/{inspection_id}\nLLMReportGenerateRequest
LlmRoute -> LlmService: generatellmreportdraft(db,\ninspection_id, templateversion)

LlmService -> DB: Cargar Inspection + fields + evidences
DB --> LlmService: Datos de inspección
LlmService -> DB: Cargar Transcription(s)
DB --> LlmService: Transcripciones

LlmService -> SnapshotBuilder: buildsnapshot(inspection,\ntranscriptions)
SnapshotBuilder --> LlmService: snapshot

LlmService -> LlmService: Construir generalsection,\ncriticalsection, fieldssection,\nevidencesection, ocrsection,\ntranscriptionsection,\ndeterministicconclusion
LlmService -> LlmFactory: getllm()
LlmFactory --> LlmService: ChatOllama
LlmService -> Ollama: structured output request\ncon prompt + snapshot + sections
Ollama --> LlmService: secciones estructuradas

LlmService -> LlmService: renderfinaltext(...)
LlmService -> DB: INSERT ReportDraft(\ninspection_id, title,\ntemplateversion,\nstatus="generatedllm",\ngeneratedtext,\nsourcesnapshot,\ngenerationtimems)
DB --> LlmService: Draft persistido

LlmService --> LlmRoute: ReportDraft
LlmRoute --> Frontend: 201 ReportDraftResponse
Frontend --> Inspector: Muestra borrador con LLM

@enduml